<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus Lord, my best love Thou art,</l><l>Rid all rocks that hide in my heart;</l><l>Gladly I Thy bondslave of love would be,</l><l>One heart, one will ever with Thee</l><l>Though my heart is oft not subdued,</l><l>Still Thy way alone it would choose;</l><l>All I yearn for is what Thy heart desires,</l><l>In Thy love alone peace I find.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus Lord, my best love Thou art,</l><l>Ne’er again from Thee I’d depart;</l><l>Never hide Thy dear, smiling face from me.</l><l>To none else I’d cling, Lord, but Thee.</l><l>To Thee, Lord, my all I outpour,</l><l>How Thy love my heart deeply fills,</l><l>My eternal portion, most precious Lord,</l><l>None but Thee I want evermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
